## Notes on the design decisions

- **Optimistic UI** — the button flips instantly, then rolls back if the request rejects, so it feels snappy without lying to the user.
- **`aria-pressed`** — the button is a toggle, so screen readers announce "Follow, toggle button, pressed" rather than relying on the label text alone.
- **`alt=""` on the avatar** — the name is already read out next to it, so a descriptive alt would just be noise.
- **`min-width: 0` on the info column** — the classic flexbox fix that lets long names truncate with an ellipsis instead of blowing out the card.
- **Initials fallback** — if `avatarUrl` is missing or 404s, you get a clean monogram instead of a broken-image icon.

