## Notes

- **No dependencies** — everything is built on `Intl`, which is available in Node ≥ 14 and all modern browsers.
- **Locale-aware** — pass `locale` to get localized output without changing any code.
- **Time zones** — pass `timeZone` (e.g. `"UTC"`) to format dates in a specific zone.
- **Fails loudly** — invalid inputs throw `TypeError` rather than returning `"Invalid Date"`.
- **Testable** — `formatRelativeDate` accepts a `baseDate` so you can write deterministic tests.

